{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05344","headline":"塞外三首 一 · 郑愔","name":"塞外三首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"塞外萧条望，征人此路赊。\n边声乱朔马，秋色引胡笳。\n遥嶂侵归日，长城带晚霞。\n断蓬飞古戍，连鴈聚寒沙。\n海暗云无叶，山春雪作花。\n丈夫期报主，万里独辞家。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑愔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05344.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05344","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}